{"last_link_id": 47, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "extra_option", "links": [15], "label": "extra_option", "type": "JoyCaption2ExtraOption", "localized_name": "extra_option"}], "size": [705.5999755859375, 706], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [1296.7235107421875, 2286.867919921875], "widgets_values": [false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, "Huluwa"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 9, "type": "LayerUtility: JoyCaptionBeta1ExtraOptions", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: JoyCaptionBeta1ExtraOptions"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "links": [12], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [454.0895080566406, 337.1842041015625], "pos": [2686.993896484375, 2617.92578125], "widgets_values": ["", "This is a high-quality photograph featuring a bottle of Flor d'Orílica perfume placed on a large, textured rock in a vibrant, sunlit field. The perfume bottle is rectangular with slightly rounded corners, made of clear glass, revealing the golden amber liquid inside. The bottle has a square, transparent, geometrically-cut cap with a golden metal neck piece. A white label with black text reads \"Flor d'Orílica\" and \"Essência Natural 30ml\" in the center. The background is a bright blue sky with a few soft, white clouds, and is filled with a variety of colorful flowers. Orange marigolds dominate the scene, with their vivid petals and rounded shapes, interspersed with white daisies with yellow centers. The flowers are in various stages of bloom, adding a lively, natural texture to the image. The rock on which the perfume bottle rests is light brown with a rough, uneven surface. The overall composition is bright and cheerful, with a strong contrast between the clear, reflective glass of the perfume bottle and the vivid, colorful flowers and sky in the background. The photograph uses a shallow depth of field, making the bottle the sharp focal point while the background is softly blurred."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 10, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 12, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "links": [], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [312.2679443359375, 248.2139129638672], "pos": [3271.0771484375, 2691.990234375], "widgets_values": ["", "这是一张高质量的照片，其中包括一瓶弗洛尔·德奥利卡（Flord'Orílica）香水，放在一个充满活力的阳光田地的大质感岩石上。香水瓶是矩形的，略微圆角，由透明玻璃制成，露出里面的金琥珀色液体。该瓶有一个正方形的，透明的几何切割帽，带有金属金属颈部。中央的白色标签上带有黑色文字的白色标签上写着“ Flord'Orílica”和“EssênciaNatural 30ml”。背景是明亮的蓝天，上面有一些柔软的白云，并充满了各种五颜六色的花朵。橙色万寿菊在现场占据主导地位，其生动的花瓣和圆形的形状，上面散布着白色的雏菊，上面有黄色的中心。这些花处于盛开的各个阶段，为图像增添了活泼的自然质地。香水瓶静置的岩石是浅棕色，表面粗糙，不均匀。整体构图明亮而开朗，在香水瓶的清晰，反射玻璃与背景中鲜艳，彩色的花朵和天空之间存在强烈的对比。该照片使用浅景深，使瓶子成为鲜明的焦点，而背景则模糊。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 11, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 13, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 21}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [11], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [424.88970947265625, 310], "pos": [3206.251708984375, 2313.409912109375], "widgets_values": ["english", "chinese (simplified)", false, "", "", "GoogleTranslator", "", "proxy_hide", "authorization_hide"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 12, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 14, "type": "DeepTranslatorTextNode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "DeepTranslatorTextNode"}, "order":